(slower-hummingbird-sv05-basic-waypoint-6dof)
*title Hummingbird basic one-meter waypoint and altitude maneuver
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle aero-load-mode=direct-wrench aero-wrench-frame=source-z-up rotor-allocation=quad-x rotor-arm-m=0.17 rotor-thrust-coefficient=5.57e-6 rotor-reaction-torque-coefficient=1.36e-7 rotor-speed-min=0 rotor-speed-max=1500 reference-area=1.0 reference-length=0.34 dry-mass-kg=0.5 inertia-x=0.00365 inertia-y=0.00368 inertia-z=0.00703 envelope-max-speed=10 rotor-force-model=individual-rotor-source rotor-drag-xy-coefficient=0.000119 rotor-drag-z-coefficient=0.000232 rotor-translational-lift-coefficient=0.00339 rotor-frame-drag-x-coefficient=0.005 rotor-frame-drag-y-coefficient=0.005 rotor-frame-drag-z-coefficient=0.01 aero-source-quality=source-derived
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0 longitude-deg=0 altitude-m=2.18
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0 start-longitude-deg=0 duration-s=8 powered-end-s=8 powered-speed-mps=0.2 powered-climb-rate-mps=0.0 position-capture-gain=0.1
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=0.2 attitude-gain=0.005 rate-damping=0.005 max-sideslip-deg=20 max-pitch-deg=3 rotorcraft-waypoint-gain-mps2-per-m=1.0 rotorcraft-velocity-damping-per-s=1.5 rotorcraft-altitude-gain-mps2-per-m=1.5 rotorcraft-altitude-damping-per-s=2.0 rotorcraft-attitude-gain-nm-per-rad=0.05 rotorcraft-rate-damping-nm-s-per-rad=0.01 rotorcraft-collective-gain-rad-s-per-mps2=20 rotorcraft-yaw-target-deg=0.0 rotorcraft-yaw-gain-nm-per-rad=0.04 rotorcraft-yaw-rate-damping-nm-s-per-rad=0.06
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=1 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=720
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*runtime control rotor-speed vehicle=1 default=468.7244338633868 lower=0 upper=1500
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378139.993958658 y=2.008890188788015e-09 z=1.559086916581515e-06 xdt=2.874948423276457e-07 ydt=-1.662464318895446e-09 zdt=-1.321951467652493e-06 qw=0.7071067612658339 qx=6.573027929324376e-11 qy=-0.7071068011072607 qz=-1.909471849009788e-11 time=0 mass=0.5 propellant_mass=0
  *segment 1 waypoint
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.001
    *fly propnav=4
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *when time>8 stop
*end
